  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Craving something quick, fresh, and satisfying? This gluten free sandwich layers lightly toasted gluten free bread with creamy mayo, tangy Dijon, tender turkey, crisp lettuce, and juicy tomato for the perfect balance of crunch and flavor. It’s easy to customize with your favorite add-ins like avocado or hummus, and it comes together in minutes for a busy-day lunch or snack. If you’re looking for a simple gluten free sandwich that tastes like a café classic, this one’s your go-to.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-gluten-free-sandwich\">Why You’ll Love This gluten free sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-gluten-free-sandwich\">How to Make gluten free sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-gluten-free-sandwich\">Pro Tips for Making gluten free sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-gluten-free-sandwich\">How to Serve this gluten free sandwich</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-gluten-free-sandwich\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This gluten free sandwich</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Deliciously satisfying without the gluten guilt.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite fresh ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for any meal, from lunch to a quick snack.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make, even on your busiest days.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-7123\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"7123\" data-servings=\"1\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm